{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01322",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 4.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Hi there, the chair's free, sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.8,
      "end_seconds": 9.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "well, um, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.69,
      "end_seconds": 13.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.78,
      "end_seconds": 20.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Well, mainly I've been wanting contraception. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.74,
      "end_seconds": 28.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "so, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.55,
      "end_seconds": 33.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Well, I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.43,
      "end_seconds": 38.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "What about slightly heavy periods, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.22,
      "end_seconds": 44.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, for about a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.74,
      "end_seconds": 50.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "have you been wanting contraception at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.69,
      "end_seconds": 58.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "I had a a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.61,
      "end_seconds": 77.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "And what about breast lumps or smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.19,
      "end_seconds": 80.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.09,
      "end_seconds": 84.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.48,
      "end_seconds": 86.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.01,
      "end_seconds": 90.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.19,
      "end_seconds": 94.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Migraines, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.23,
      "end_seconds": 97.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.34,
      "end_seconds": 102.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.2,
      "end_seconds": 106.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "alright, migraines, that matches what I have here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.92,
      "end_seconds": 120.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.75,
      "end_seconds": 127.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Not currently, but as a youngster diclofenac gave me wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.56,
      "end_seconds": 133.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.58,
      "end_seconds": 150.11,
      "duration_seconds": 15.53,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I look after my grandchildren most days. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.98,
      "end_seconds": 153.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.25,
      "end_seconds": 160.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "Propranolol. I take it 40 milligrams, twice a day for the migraine prevention."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.17,
      "end_seconds": 161.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.96,
      "end_seconds": 171.27,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, every morning my neighbour said I should get it looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.81,
      "end_seconds": 175.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.58,
      "end_seconds": 189.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.75,
      "end_seconds": 207.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 85, pressure 126 over 74, respiratory rate 14. And temp 36.9 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.56,
      "end_seconds": 210.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.26,
      "end_seconds": 215.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "So, take a a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.49,
      "end_seconds": 232.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.06,
      "end_seconds": 256.36,
      "duration_seconds": 19.3,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.06,
      "end_seconds": 260.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Well, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.17,
      "end_seconds": 270.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's suitable for hormonal contraception with no risk factors, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.09,
      "end_seconds": 293.27,
      "duration_seconds": 13.18,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on levonorgestrel and ethinylestradiol, 150 micrograms and 30 micrograms, once a day, long term. You take it by mouth. That should help with contraception."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.97,
      "end_seconds": 295.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.86,
      "end_seconds": 314.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: you get leg swelling or severe headaches. In that case don't wait. Let's review you in three months. Right, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.1,
      "end_seconds": 320.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "right, I'll do that that thank you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.44,
      "end_seconds": 323.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}